 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGranite & Co Ltd\n221 Baker Street, M1 2AB Manchester, United Kingdom\nVAT No: GB929825209\nReg No: GB-608420\n\n                                                     MASTER SERVICES\n                                                           AGREEMENT\n                                                           PAID [circled]\n\nFROM\n\nGranite & Co Ltd\n221 Baker Street\nM1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom\nVAT: GB929825209\n\n                                                                 BILL TO\n                                                                 Granite & Co Ltd\n                                                                 221 Baker Street\n                                                                 BS1 5TR Bristol\n                                                                 United Kingdom\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 17/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Granite & Co Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Manchester (\"Party A\"), and Granite & Co Ltd,\nwith its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Bristol (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\nParty A   Granite & Co Ltd / Harry Whitfield\nParty B   Granite & Co Ltd / Harry Whitfield\nDate      17/02/2026",
